@startuml
title Temporal - успешный push
participant "Сервис банка" as Bank
participant API
database "Реестр PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Starter / signal relay" as Relay
participant Temporal as T
participant "Workflow worker" as W
participant "Activity worker" as A
participant "Push-провайдер" as Push
actor "Приложение" as App
Bank -> API: событие + бизнес-ключ
API -> DB: notification + outbox, commit
API --> Bank: принято
Relay -> DB: прочитать outbox
Relay -> T: start(notification_id)
T -> W: workflow task
W -> T: schedule send, durable timer
T -> A: activity send push
A -> Push: send(attempt_id), TTL 3 с
Push --> A: принято
A -> T: activity result
Push -> App: сообщение
App -> API: delivery ACK
API -> DB: receipt + inbox, commit
Relay -> T: signal delivered
T -> W: обработать signal
W -> T: отменить таймер, schedule projection
T -> A: записать DELIVERED
A -> DB: идемпотентно обновить проекцию
A -> T: activity complete
W -> T: завершить workflow
@enduml
